  localStorage.wslha_user on page load so logged-in users don't
  have to re-enter their details
- rides.astro: restore user's name/phone after clicking 'new ride'
  (previously cleared all fields)
- supabase/schema.sql: complete DB schema with tables, RLS policies,
  indexes, and verify_otp function

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015Yge7ejVc6YJmfRESecrbx
---
